// HONESTY-SWEEP (2026-11-07) - probe Q-HS6 for the capture lane (W34-I6a review N2).
// Queue: docs/pine/capture-queue-2026-11-07-honesty-sweep.md
// Chart: AMEX:SPY 1D, AFTER THE CLOSE. Read the plot values from the chart model.
// The question: does a wrapped line continue ACROSS a comment-only line? A compile error is the reading.
//
//   W01  a switch arm `close > open => close` wrapped onto `      + 1` with a comment-only line between
//        (close + 1 on up bars if the wrap continues; a compile error, or close alone, says otherwise)
//   W02  CONTROL: the same arm with no comment line
//   W03  an ordinary expression `close +` wrapped onto `  1` across a comment-only line (the host lane's
//        lexer joins it today; this row settles that reading too)
//@version=6
indicator("vw-hs6-wrap-comment", overlay = false)
w1 = switch
    close > open => close
      // a comment-only line inside the wrap
      + 1
    => open
plot(w1, "W01")
w2 = switch
    close > open => close
      + 1
    => open
plot(w2, "W02")
w3 = close +
  // a comment-only line inside the wrap
  1
plot(w3, "W03")
